#NEXUS

[ brusatte2008b_fig6: Carcharodontosaurid slanted cladogram. The Carcharodontosaurus line, Acrocanthosaurus, Tyrannotitan and Eocarcharia meet the backbone at one point, a four-way node. 'Without Neovenator' is the figure's title, not a clade name. 8 tips, 1 polytomies (4 children). Sample 4 case (census 2, seed 20261201). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

BEGIN TAXA;
    DIMENSIONS NTAX=8;
    TAXLABELS
        Sinraptor
        Allosaurus
        Carcharodontosaurus
        Mapusaurus
        Giganotosaurus
        Acrocanthosaurus
        Tyrannotitan
        Eocarcharia
    ;
END;

BEGIN TREES;
    TREE brusatte2008b_fig6 = [&R] (Sinraptor,(Allosaurus,((Carcharodontosaurus,(Mapusaurus,Giganotosaurus)),Acrocanthosaurus,Tyrannotitan,Eocarcharia)));
END;
